      "claim": "Independently of arrival, the waiting period was never served. The effective in-geofence dwell is 0 seconds - longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec 0.0, run_count 0 - against a 300 second minimum for LARGE_VENUE, a shortfall of 300.0 seconds. POL-NS-06 refunds the fee in full on a shortfall, whether or not the rider was present and whether or not the rider responded to messages. The accumulation route in limb (i) is unavailable because no traffic advisory covers these kerbs at all: I cite the absence of EV-ADVIS-00206-01 rather than asserting it, so there is no present and populated advisory that could permit separate in-geofence intervals to be summed, and nothing reduces the required minimum. EV-GPS-00206 is disclosed at weight 0.8 with issue LOW_SAMPLE_RATE - a cadence tag that leaves this 0-second dwell measurement untouched.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
